{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Each round begins on the main game board, where players take turns rolling dice to move or spending coins earned from minigames to gain advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae With over 16 minigames, there's something for everyone. Some are solo, others in teams, compete in a rotating lineup of unique and action-packed challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 Every minigame is a chance to collect coins and win a crown. Use those coins to gain an edge: add a whole extra die to your toss, teleport to any other player's board position, or skip someone\u2019s turn by trapping them in a cage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for get-togethers, holidays, and game nights with friends: <i>Couch Party</i> is a game for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265580?t=1769699249","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265580?t=1769699249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265580/a6e3d667e252cc8ce6e38c73e8eab6697aff06c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769699249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265580/a6e3d667e252cc8ce6e38c73e8eab6697aff06c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769699249","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Each round begins on the main game board, where players take turns rolling dice to move or spending coins earned from minigames to gain advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae With over 16 minigames, there's something for everyone. Some are solo, others in teams, compete in a rotating lineup of unique and action-packed challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 Every minigame is a chance to collect coins and win a crown. Use those coins to gain an edge: add a whole extra die to your toss, teleport to any other player's board position, or skip someone\u2019s turn by trapping them in a cage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for get-togethers, holidays, and game nights with friends: <i>Couch Party</i> is a game for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hani"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265580/2f17444a1b1c1e4a19ed7d01245cbfc45672cfd8/header.jpg?t=1769699249","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265580/257894160/bcaf6fdbf408d68d2a0adec809cf5b292f54bf4d/1761345508/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761379638","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265580/257894160/bcaf6fdbf408d68d2a0adec809cf5b292f54bf4d/1761345508/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761379638","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265580/257894160/bcaf6fdbf408d68d2a0adec809cf5b292f54bf4d/1761345508/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761379638","id":257222301,"name":"Couch Party!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222301/4a100e1c589a36ac0f6a8a113db80adee3159949/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761379638"}],"name":"Couch Party!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-63